{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "88847f1b-163b-8f94-bff4-aaf553442291",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:54:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:53:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:53:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Um, I know City Hall is closed today, it is Sunday? But this is the number for the storm, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:53:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line's open on weekends. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:53:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My name is Judith Lawton. I am calling for my mother, she is in her eighties. Her house is eighty-six Ruggles Avenue. The catch basin at the corner is full of leaves, and the water comes back into her driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:53:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From the storm yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:53:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, Friday into Saturday. It is not the first time the drain is blocked. I went this morning and took the leaves off the grate with my hands. It was better for ten minutes, maybe? Then the leaves came again and the water too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a lot of work for you. Those leaves just keep sliding back over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So I want to ask, when did they come last to clean this one? Does somebody know? Nobody came, I think, for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't see the cleaning log from this desk. I'll put in a request with the corner and your address, and the crew supervisor can check the last visit. Is it a cross street you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at the corner right by her house. Sorry, my mind is on my Italian lesson, I am learning Italian, so I say, um, ecco, the corner, ecco. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. Can I get a number for a callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Crews are stretched after a storm, but this is logged. Please don't go back in the street, it's not safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Grazie. Thank you."
    }
  ],
